   "en": "⟦0⟧ is the name you have given to the asset. This may be prefixed with various other segments, such as ⟦1⟧ for idea images, etc. ⟦2⟧ is the image to use for the progress bar. ⟦3⟧ is the image to use for the background of the progress bar. ⟦4⟧ defines the unprogressed color of the bar. It is decimal RGBA. Alpha is optional. ⟦5⟧ defines the progressed color of the bar. It is decimal RGBA. Alpha is optional. ⟦6⟧ defines the size of the progress bar section in height and width. ⟦7⟧ is used to define an effect state to apply to the image, i.e. the button press effect on a button image. Effects are found in ⟦8⟧. Multiple can be defined to add multiple effects. ⟦9⟧ defines whether the progress bar is horizontal or not. By default a bar is horizontal. ⟦10⟧ defines the precision of the progressbar or into how many frames it's split into. Defaults to 100 if unset.",
